  "body": "### Description\n\nIf we start a password reset via Element and then click on the link in the password reset confirmation email, then a 404 Nginx error is displayed in the browser window.\r\n\r\nThe link in the email is as follows:\r\nhttps://chat.slawinski.de/_synapse/client/password_reset/email/submit_token?token=X&client_secret=X&sid=X\r\n\r\nThe error did not exist in previous Synapse versions.\r\nSince which version the error exists I can not say.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Request passwort reset in Element.\r\n- Click on link in reset confirmation email\n\n### Homeserver\n\nchat.slawinski.de\n\n### Synapse Version\n\n1.68\n\n### Installation Method\n\nDebian packages from packages.matrix.org\n\n### Platform\n\nServer: Ubuntu 20.04 LTS\r\nClient: macOS, iOS and Android\n\n### Relevant log output\n\n```shell\nWill attach later if needed\n```\n\n\n### Anything else that would be useful to know?\n\n_No response_",
